        "label": "Primary Live Classroom Path",
        "focus": ["teacher", "teacher_app", "offline_engine", "linguistic_engine", "acoustic_compiler"],
        "note": "Teacher Hindi voice → Web Speech ASR → 4-Tier Linguistic Engine (7,503 entries, 0.004 ms) → Acoustic Compiler → 0.85x native Santali TTS."
      },
      {
        "id": "classroom-mesh",
        "label": "Zero-Internet Hotspot Mesh (< 1s Relay)",
        "focus": ["teacher_app", "hotspot_server", "student_app", "student_companion"],
        "note": "Teacher device acts as Wi-Fi Access Point running embedded LocalClassroomServer (Port 8888). Real-time translation events and active lesson slides broadcast to student companion tablets in < 1 second without SIM or internet."
